# RTK is mandatory

Always prefix every shell command with `rtk`.

- `rtk git ...` instead of raw `git ...`
- `rtk pytest ...` instead of raw `pytest ...`
- `rtk curl ...` instead of raw `curl ...`
- In command chains, prefix each command separately.
- Use absolute paths; do not use `cd`.

See `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` for the repository-wide agent policy.
